        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE Lettings take great pleasure in introducing this fantastic 2 bed / 1 bath apartment to the letting market on Amiens Street, Dublin 1.\nAmiens Street is ideally located within easy reach of Dublin City Centre, with a host of shops, cafés, restaurants and amenities all close by. The area is well serviced by excellent public transport links, making access to the city centre and surrounding areas extremely convenient. Connolly Station is also within easy reach, while the IFSC and Docklands are just a short distance away.\nBright and spacious living accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, large open-plan living/dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, two generous bedrooms and a main bathroom.\nThe apartment is presented in good condition throughout and benefits from well-proportioned rooms, ample natural light and a convenient city centre location.\nThis property would suit a wide range of tenants and is ideally positioned for those looking to be close to Dublin City Centre and all it has to offer.\nViewing is highly advised Contact RAY COOKE LETTINGS today for further information.\n\nAdditional Features;\n- 2 bed / 1 bath\n- Apartment\n- Comes fully furnished\n- Top quality windows & doors\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\n- Top quality flooring\n- Very spacious rooms\n- Fully fitted kitchen\n- Ample additional storage\n- Located in the heart of Dublin 1\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\n- Viewing highly advised\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
